<title>SOUTH KOREA: South Korea's 1996 Q4 GDP rises 7.2 pct.</title>
<headline>South Korea's 1996 Q4 GDP rises 7.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's gross domestic product (GDP) grew a real 7.2 percent in the fourth quarter of 1996 against a 6.7 percent rise a year earlier, provisional figures of the Bank of Korea (BOK) showed on Thursday</p>
<p>				   Q4 1996	Q3 1996    Q4 1995</p>
<p> GDP growth (year/year)	+7.2	   +6.6	  +6.7</p>
<p> GDP amount (1990 prices)   78.19	  69.40	 72.91</p>
<p> GNP growth (year/year)	+6.8	   +6.5	  +6.4</p>
<p> GNP amount (1990 prices)   77.11	  68.63	 72.20</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures in percentage and trillions of won.</p>
</text>
